      "writtenOn": "2022-02-07T17:29:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What would you like me to elaborate on? :) \n\nEffectively, the cquery starlark syntax is that you have two options:\n1. By expression.  `5`, `\"hello\"`, `[x for x in foo.bar_list]` are all valid\n2. By file which must necessarily contain a function definition `def format(target)`. This format function will be invoked (and result printed) for each configured target in the query.",
      "revId": "9e6fbf1a81122d8f237679253a6303e91c155594",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
